Source: percona-pg-telemetry
Section: database
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Percona Development Team <info@percona.com>
Build-Depends:
 debhelper (>= 9), percona-postgresql-server-dev-@PG_VERSION@

Package: percona-pg-telemetry-@PG_VERSION@
Architecture: any
Depends:
 percona-telemetry-agent,
 postgresql-@PG_VERSION@ | percona-postgresql-@PG_VERSION@,
 ${misc:Depends},
 ${shlibs:Depends},
Description: Percona telemetry extension for PostgreSQL @PG_VERSION@
 The percona_pg_telemetry is an extension for Percona telemetry data
 collection for PostgreSQL.
